{"server":"cn","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_02_end","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_02","title":"腿部拆卸疗法","storyCode":"EP-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"1712a880b2d6157a1eee67c636675726436058cf6fa56abe7c3da1389a2764f8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"船员们因为物资匮乏准备带着棘刺去冒险追猎盐鳞，而胡安娜则似乎隐藏着什么与海嗣相关的恐怖秘密。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......计程仪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是以前水手们用来记录航程的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前接触过这些东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我的老师带着我学过很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的老师胆子还真大啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要一直站在我背后讲个不停吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我想吗，小子？是水手长吩咐我要和你寸步不离。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得我们的距离有点过近了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这声音......好熟悉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"捕捉到盐粒流动的声音，伊西多警觉地环顾四周，看见在船员的身后，熟悉的凹痕出现在盐层表面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快闪开，有盐鳞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃鳞屎了！你这小子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盐鳞","speakerId":"avg_npc_1585_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啾叽......啾叽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就为它把我撞开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会以为盐层下面是巨鳞吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那种巨鳞来时地面会有剧烈震动。这种小家伙只会留下一些凹痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，它们和宝宝是同一物种，能造成什么破坏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道那疯婆娘找你来干嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盐鳞","speakerId":"avg_npc_1585_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啾叽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个......是一种生物吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盐鳞","speakerId":"avg_npc_1585_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啾叽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的盐鳞不止一种吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，大大小小共有几十种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你们的船帆使用了皮革材质，那些皮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是盐鳞的皮，我们的帐篷也用它搭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们帐篷外晒的肉干......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是盐鳞做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盐鳞的骨头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那它们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盐鳞","speakerId":"avg_npc_1585_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啾叽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不一样，除非迫不得已，我们不会伤害它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疯婆娘很喜欢它们，曾经想过捕捉到船上来饲养，但这种盐鳞一旦离群就会迅速失去活力，所以她最终还是放弃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那它为什么会来到船上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧哼哧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝宝是被族群抛弃的孩子，因为身体过于孱弱，无法跟上其他盐鳞的行进，幸好......疯婆娘捡到了它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盐鳞","speakerId":"avg_npc_1585_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧哼哧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们要离开了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正常，它们不会长时间停留在一个地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一条条盐鳞重又钻入盐层下，迅速游向远处。\n盐层上，数条凹痕交织相错，仿若镜面碎裂的纹路。\n伊西多觉得有趣，攀上一块巉岩，试图从高处远眺裂纹延伸的方向。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一站稳，竟看到另一条巨大的裂纹以极快的速度向这里冲刺而来，所到之处，盐礁与骸骨尽数被吞噬。\n直到此时，伊西多才明白，那些盐鳞并非离开，而是逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（焦急地转圈）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......这绝对不正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到什么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点躲开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"转瞬间，分裂的地面如同巨口，要将狂奔的两人吞食入腹。\n心急之下，塞斯克一脚踩空，脚踝被拖入塌陷的地缝中，他发出惨烈的嚎叫。\n伊西多紧紧抓住他的胳膊，却发现根本无法与自然的巨力相抗。\n就在两人将一起被吞噬时，塌陷奇迹般地停了下来，裂缝将船员的小腿紧紧夹住，只见一片血肉模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盐层表面开裂，好像有人掉进去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你小子滚回来！休想跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......别丢我一个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧......哼哧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的同伴就要来了，你会得救的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......你要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咬住伊西多的裤脚）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，终归是你们找不到的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不、不行......你不能走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"水手长......有、有命令，我......得盯着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吭——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久没来看你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"计划很顺利......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们是要冒一些风险，但那都是值得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们终将扬起风帆，回到海洋的怀抱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会为我高兴吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"洞窟中，金属刮擦石头的声音渐响，一只身形细长的海嗣以扭曲的姿势缓缓爬出。\n它身上的触肢各执一把武器，刺耳的声音便是锋刃划在石壁上发出的。\n它缓缓靠近盐鳞肉，慢慢吞吃，眼睛却一直注视着胡安娜。\n胡安娜对上它的目光，静静等待着海嗣给自己回答。\n但她心里清楚，这只是一只全无理智与人性可言的野兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会离开的，不论付出什么代价，我们都会离开盐漠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜转身离开洞穴，只留下结束进食后的海嗣犹如困兽一般四处碰撞。\n落石不断滚下，最终，海嗣不再寻找出路，渐渐安静下来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天......怎么回事？是不是那小子干的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是，是我自己......但、但他跑了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁顾得上那家伙！来搭把手，把他拽出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！！我的腿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"水手长，他的腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恐、恐怕保不住了！得叫船医来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们早就没有船医了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可除了船医没人能做切除，他会大出血死在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不想死在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"水手长，救救我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子......我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我来，我知道怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保证他会活下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......你来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咬住刀柄，咬紧点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有点痛，忍住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"画通缉令的人，怎么把你画成了这副模样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么这么快就接受这人是棘刺了，刚刚不是还在据理力争吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一他是被那些强盗胁迫，或是被诬陷了呢？他嘴笨，肯定解释不清。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他如你所说，是个清清白白的好人，那不管是强盗嗜血的凶性，还是盐漠险恶的环境，都不会允许他活过这些时日。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......那些强盗会对他做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的手段......不，你不会愿意知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们费尽力气把他们赶出了镇子，但他们也掳走了镇上的不少好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的首领是个彻头彻尾的怪物，能够腐化他人内心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该做饭了......嗯？谁动了我的厨房？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（仔细地嗅闻）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好香......是这个罐子里传出来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炖鳞心？这不是胡安娜女士的拿手菜嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经烂乎了，得赶紧把火熄了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大静谧时，大半雅隆镇都被海水淹没，只剩下山顶上的一小片区域幸免于难，但很快也因为饥荒而陷入混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海水退去前，是这些海盗乘船来到了这里。他们声称，自己会为混乱的雅隆带来秩序......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但实际上，他们只是四处烧杀抢掠，令镇民们屈服于他们残酷的统治。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们走过的地方，都会被付之一炬......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救火！快救火！！锅爆炸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，怎么又着火了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见鳞屎了，哈维尔！我说过多少次！别再让那个近视眼在厨房帮工了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近视的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊......原来那是鳞油......对不起，是我没看清！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我滚开，混账！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哈维尔人呢？赶紧过来！跟我去指挥灭火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快，用盐把火盖住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊！着了，我的衣服，我刚缝的鳞皮大衣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饥饿的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......香......烤鳞皮的味道......香......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他很幸运，能活下来，那些强盗自己的生存条件已经足够恶劣，更不可能优待俘虏，他现在恐怕正遭受着饥饿与干渴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗，极境？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事......证裁官阁下，请继续讲吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更不用说，他在那些强盗手中可能会遭受的刑罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会毫无顾忌地公开处罚反抗的人，将他们开膛破肚，斩断手脚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会动用私刑......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开、开膛破肚，斩断手脚......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——啊——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗬......嗬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿点酒来！给他喝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鲁斯！鲁斯！我的腿怎么样......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......躺下，安静......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腿在盐漠里，不会再疼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞斯克，我们在这里守着你呢，放心吧，你的治疗很成功，你死不了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是把他的腿卸下来了，称不上治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还活着，对我们来说这就是治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"极境，冷静点，目前没有任何证据能表明棘刺已经丧生于强盗之手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂，我不愿思考这种可能性，但......我们又要去哪里寻找他的消息呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"温蒂没有回答，远处，几具尸体挂在镇子外的旗杆上，随风晃动。\n一只飞羽落在上面，叼取腐肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，两位是审判庭的客人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些是被执裁官阁下抓住的强盗，按照教义，被处以绞刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平静的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尸体会悬挂在那里警示其余的强盗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在强盗窝里也是死，要是回到镇子里，被当成了强盗肯定也是死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小伙子，你手里的这几张纸还要吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......已经没用了，老人家你拿去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你，小伙子，我终于找到材料糊我的床了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这纸上画的不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您见过上面这家伙吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我还收留过他一晚呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几天后船队要进入盐漠捕猎盐鳞，我希望那小子能够加入捕猎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近一个月我们损失惨重，原本的船医与领航员都牺牲在审判庭的围剿中，我想让那小子接替他们的职务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来这就是你解决人力不足的办法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇向我保证过，我才允许他加入发掘船帮助你们，但他今天却差点跑掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你们又和我说，要他加入捕鳞船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士......我知道这小子是珍贵的炼金术师，但他也是使剑的好手，还会点医术，在捕鳞的过程中，他会派上大用场的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这无异于放他离开，他肯定会找机会逃脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是个海盗，鲁斯，没有那样的好心肠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，求您，经历几次围剿后我们已经损失了太多人手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在船队里，不是只有您需要他......我们也需要他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲁斯，他不是什么老实孩子，调皮得很，你要怎么保证他能乖乖的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他与帕斯卡拉素昧平生，却愿意在她被审判庭追杀时出手相救，将她安全送往镇子后，也从未索取任何报酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他本可以放弃营救塞斯克独自离开，但他没有。他选择折返回来，帮助我们救下他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......他其实是个热心的好孩子，非常善良。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只需向他展示出，我们有多需要他，他不会坐视不理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那支队伍还有消息传来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至今没有......事关我们接下来一个月的食物储备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你那个朋友我记得是个年轻小伙子吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"长得也还不错，可惜......年纪轻轻的就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了......不用说了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去找他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"极境？极境！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂，棘刺现在一定在那里等着我们去救他......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，通讯器。你留在镇子里，我要到盐漠去一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......可......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇子里发生了什么就用它联系！我们互相照应——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意安全——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"极境！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺，等着我！我来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人，怎么就不听人把话讲完呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，您本来是想说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是感慨一下，那孩子年纪轻轻的回到伊比利亚学什么剑术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蹒跚的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"到别的国家过日子不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面包......被烧焦了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该也能吃吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这群不让人省心的崽子......我迟早有天要把他们的脑袋揍开花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好没造成太严重的损失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子怎么抱着一块炭在啃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我饿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把手里的东西扔了，跟我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加入捕鳞船之前，你要学的东西还多得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捕鳞船，什么捕鳞船？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
